                "retweet_count": 512,
                "source": "Sprout Social",
                "text": "A farmer in Vermont who voted for President Trump called me to say that his health care premium was rising from $900 a month to $3,200 a month if the ACA tax credits expire.\n\nHe told me, \"You don't have to worry about my premium costs anymore, because my family is dropping our health care.\"\n\nI do worry about him, and about the millions of Americans who will lose their health care if Republicans refuse to compromise with Democrats to extend the tax credits.",
