                "text": "A Vermonter wrote to me this week. He and his wife work full time, pay their taxes, contribute to the community.\n\nTheir health insurance is going to cost them $15,000 more in 2026 when Republicans let ACA health care tax credits expire. Now they're faced with deciding whether to drop their health care or spend their retirement savings.\n\nMillions of Americans are agonizing over these same choices. It could all be avoided if Republicans come to the table.",
